{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Alpha access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our Discord server to follow updates and for access to closed alpha tests.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Summon enemies to attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instead of fixed waves like in other tower defenses, you choose the enemies that will siege your opponent's base! Outwit the other players by choosing when to summon units that bolster your economy for a late game win and when to pressure their defenses with units with special abilities and attacks.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991650/extras/LaneCloseUp.png?t=1742916477\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize your summons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own loadouts of units to summon in battle to fit your play style and overthrow your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991650/extras/LoadoutEditor.png?t=1742916477\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1991650?t=1742916477","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1991650?t=1742916477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991650/b85e90911fe980d5c7b0028646b276e3e9b2d495/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742916477","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991650/b85e90911fe980d5c7b0028646b276e3e9b2d495/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742916477","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 